  "limitations": [
    "These reports describe public pipelines including immutable buffers and adapter allocation; they do not establish isolated kernel or allocation parity.",
    "Generated SIMD word helpers inline their packed operations, but surrounding loops still call checked byte/word stores, reference-count helpers and natural-number paths. Stores remain visible and no containment rule is bypassed.",
    "The padding change is adopted after 100 focused goldens passed on both frontends. The full 48-row timed sweep remains the pre-padding snapshot; paired padding results and candidate preflights identify the adopted bytes separately.",
    "Frozen snapshots are retained in local build directories and identified by committed manifests; patches reconstruct experimental sources from the identified baseline.",
    "No Cargo build, full compiler suite or library implementation edit occurred in this lane."
  ]
